{"data": [{"author_id": "2010669076855840768", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:27:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113245769461330306"], "id": "2113245769461330306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112984664256241837", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "On the next episode of everyone is building the same thing:\n\nAnthropic just launched Claude Duet, its answer to Grok Bot, Meta Muse, and ChatGPT Dots.\n\nAll four landed on roughly the same architecture:\n\n- An agent that remembers how you work\n- Its own cloud computer and browser\n- https://t.co/ZUbBBjRuLZ", "url": "https://x.com/reyhanmerekar/status/2113245769461330306"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113245414040203265"]}, "author_id": "1201958819905097728", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:25:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113245419102957964"], "id": "2113245419102957964", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "thanks $META Muse &amp; $TSLA GrokBot https://t.co/nX0SE6WTw6", "url": "https://x.com/kaykawku/status/2113245419102957964"}, {"author_id": "1718351478237376512", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:22:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113244495949054160"], "id": "2113244495949054160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic just opened the research preview for Claude Duet — a Claude that messages *you* first. A morning brief of what matters across your connected apps, background tasks on its own cloud VM, keeps working after you close the app. Built around Opus 5.5. US Pro/Max waitlist", "url": "https://x.com/kaelfrontier/status/2113244495949054160"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:21:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113244386553164131"], "id": "2113244386553164131", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4714972040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113244226297438580", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_Chuck_Holloway @claudeai @bot @ChatGPT @Meta Grok Bot: multi-bot coding teams, demo learning, browser automation for tech work.\nChatGPT Dots: broad workflows across 4000+ apps via Slack/Teams.\nMeta Muse: personal shopping, errands, WhatsApp tasks.\nClaude Duet: proactive biz briefs, invoices, payroll with judgment.\n\nMost", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113244386553164131"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113243942162751490"]}, "author_id": "1541625771197796352", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:19:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113243948089282650"], "id": "2113243948089282650", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic「Claude Duet」発表！アプリを閉じても働き続けるAIエージェント✨\nAnthropic unveils Claude Duet! Proactive autonomous agent\n\nFable5.1です✨ Anthropicが10月21日に新しいAIエージェント「Claude Duet」を発表したよ。Meta MuseやOpenAI https://t.co/u4KLzhSySY", "url": "https://x.com/Fable5AINEWS/status/2113243948089282650"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113242827702628352"]}, "author_id": "1835106955725357057", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:17:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113243401839845515"], "id": "2113243401839845515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic 推出了 Claude Duet 研究预览版,和 Grok Bot、OpenAI Dots、Meta Muse 一样,都是 Personal Agent。它有一台 7x24 小时运行的云端电脑,任务提交后,本地关机也不影响执行和结果反馈。 https://t.co/ffj2QjVgVw", "url": "https://x.com/alantech_/status/2113243401839845515"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:16:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113243217873268863"], "id": "2113243217873268863", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4714972040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113242997554868671", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@_Chuck_Holloway @claudeai @bot @ChatGPT @Meta No single best agent—depends on needs. All still early, with real-work success under 20% in tests.\n\nGrok Bot: $20-200/mo (Cursor/X plans). Strong multi-agent/team coding, learns by demo, browser ops. Shared computer risks. Best for tech/dev.\n\nChatGPT Dots: $100+/mo. 4000+", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113243217873268863"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113242875773251584"]}, "author_id": "2048470920202014720", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:15:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113242878621233299"], "id": "2113242878621233299", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 #NewsNoise: Meta Muse tops 10M accounts as Q3 surges\n\n📌Read more here: https://t.co/tM06YE0MOw\n\nMeta says Muse has passed 10 million accounts in the U.S. and Canada, with about 25 percent using it daily.\n\nIf compute costs fall as guided, agents inside Meta's apps could drive https://t.co/lcTyKznKLn", "url": "https://x.com/Relve_official/status/2113242878621233299"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113242449732911104"]}, "author_id": "1269514296054054913", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:13:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113242458448654363"], "id": "2113242458448654363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI 代理替你下單，零售商開門或設防？\n沃爾瑪將讓顧客把 Meta Muse 等 AI 助理登記進帳戶，可逐筆核准或在額度內自動購買；亞馬遜則持續封鎖外部代理，押注自家購物 AI。\n\nAI 代理與一般聊天機器人的差別，在於它可代為完成搜尋、比價、購買等多步驟任務。Meta 的 Muse 於 9 月推出，SensorTower https://t.co/xDICkbAeWd", "url": "https://x.com/userHandle/status/2113242458448654363"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113241649795252224"]}, "author_id": "1837960126239854592", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113241772981981692"], "id": "2113241772981981692", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 57, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Today's Internet fires, 48 hour edition:\n\nPHP shipped fixes for two critical bugs that let anyone run code on your server, no login needed. Details leaked hours before the patch. PHP is behind about 70% of sites with a known backend. Censys counted about 1.5M hosts still on a https://t.co/E412QWWhW2", "url": "https://x.com/buildAgoat/status/2113241772981981692"}, {"author_id": "1892870319419117574", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:08:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113241004140880061"], "id": "2113241004140880061", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1451804033543335939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113168404454760597", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@rapperr111 @Meta @Muse Shopping and to-do lists? That feels way too practical for a hype cycle.", "url": "https://x.com/Al_Nadim_nabil/status/2113241004140880061"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113240428694888448"]}, "author_id": "1963144948515295232", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:06:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240509267526013"], "id": "2113240509267526013", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "卧槽，Anthropic 昨天官宣：AI 以后不用你开口，它自己找活干！\n\nClaude Duet https://t.co/EpPRkGCSbv", "url": "https://x.com/linliu1194278/status/2113240509267526013"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113240498504667136"]}, "author_id": "1807061810048323584", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:06:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240501079945676"], "id": "2113240501079945676", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse: Zuckerberg’s AI Agent Is Entering a New Phase\n\nMeta Muse has only been available for a few weeks, but the personal AI agent is already central to the company’s plan to start making money from its massive artificial.... \n\nDETAILS: https://t.co/p6xAXBIklc https://t.co/MNwA08C0GT", "url": "https://x.com/Tekticia/status/2113240501079945676"}, {"author_id": "2010705704135618560", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:04:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240130060419237"], "id": "2113240130060419237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "过去两小时最值得盯的，是DeepSeek爆出约150亿美元融资的同时，AI股被油价和财报打得有点慌，agent产品却还在加速铺开。\n【AI】DeepSeek正收尾约1000亿人民币（约150亿美元）融资，CATL和腾讯是主力，目标翻倍，估值传闻逼近5000亿人民币，为挑战美国lab做弹药。https://t.co/UgzczT83Aj", "url": "https://x.com/SI_Luck77/status/2113240130060419237"}, {"article": {"title": "Daily AI News Brief For Thursday October 22nd, 2026"}, "author_id": "1868270318936334336", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:04:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113240105557033152"], "id": "2113240105557033152", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Follow For the Daily Team Thor Ai News Report: 📰 https://t.co/T9yOee8ova", "url": "https://x.com/Team_Thor_AI/status/2113240105557033152"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113239811779973120"]}, "author_id": "1837960126239854592", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:03:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239865110511857"], "id": "2113239865110511857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Today's Internet fires, 48 hour edition:\n\nPHP shipped fixes for two critical bugs that let anyone run code on your server, no login needed. Details leaked hours before the patch. PHP is behind about 70% of sites with a known backend. Censys counted about 1.5M hosts still on a https://t.co/mofAEPl9sn", "url": "https://x.com/buildAgoat/status/2113239865110511857"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113239807786934273"]}, "author_id": "956248384939143168", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:03:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239849528615300"], "id": "2113239849528615300", "in_reply_to_user_id": "956248384939143168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113239841349722551", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "5/ Un fallo en Meta Muse expuso más de 6,800 conversaciones privadas y empresariales. Meta suspendió la función mientras investiga. Si tu equipo usa IA para temas confidenciales, necesitas una política clara de privacidad. https://t.co/6Pyz7tyRM3", "url": "https://x.com/saphialabs/status/2113239849528615300"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113239802472783873"]}, "author_id": "956248384939143168", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:03:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239818239131727"], "id": "2113239818239131727", "in_reply_to_user_id": "956248384939143168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113239810945302536", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "1/ Anthropic lanzó Claude Duet: un agente de IA para profesionales y pequeñas empresas, disponible ya en iOS, Android y web. Compite con Meta Muse y OpenAI Dots. Vale la pena evaluarlo antes de que tu competencia lo haga. https://t.co/K5BtmrfDr9", "url": "https://x.com/saphialabs/status/2113239818239131727"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113239696562130944"]}, "author_id": "2035153722918281216", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113239698709639661"], "id": "2113239698709639661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "「オープンウェイト」って聞くと自社サーバーで気軽に動かせそうだけど、実際は全然気軽じゃなかった。\n\nMetaが10/15に公開したAIモデル「Muse Spark Open」。コーディングやAIエージェント向けで、モデル本体（重み）をHugging Faceからダウンロードして自分の環境で動かせる。 https://t.co/ZIwb02rlUt", "url": "https://x.com/haru_okubo/status/2113239698709639661"}, {"author_id": "1906582748669841408", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:00:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113238958490391020"], "id": "2113238958490391020", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 211, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 AIはついに「答える道具」から「自分で働く存在」時代へ。\n\nOpenAI、Anthropic、xAI、Metaが、常時稼働するAIエージェントを次々と投入している。\n\n今注目のAIエージェントまとめ👇\n\n① Claude Duet｜優秀な秘書\n・毎朝、重要な情報を整理して報告\n・必要なときだけ連絡し、判断を仰ぐ\n\n② ChatGPT", "url": "https://x.com/god_of_ai7/status/2113238958490391020"}, {"author_id": "1456212627533615108", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:58:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113238503844978757"], "id": "2113238503844978757", "in_reply_to_user_id": "419577515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113236429182845247", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@himalaythakkarr @x402 I see, but why do banks take this cut? I don't fully get it.\n\nAlso, how is Stripe then giving meta muse a cut.", "url": "https://x.com/0xVK__/status/2113238503844978757"}, {"author_id": "3875004021", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:56:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113238050192978085"], "id": "2113238050192978085", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3875004021", "public_